    "solution": "Let the total work required to complete the mosaic mural be represented by 1 unit of work.\n\nThe work rate of Mr. Thompson is the reciprocal of the time he takes to complete the work alone, which is 1/28 units of work per day.\nThe work rate of Ms. Rodriguez is 1/42 units of work per day.\nThe work rate of Mr. Chen is 1/84 units of work per day.\n\nFor the first 7 days, all three artisans worked together. Their combined work rate is the sum of their individual rates:\nCombined rate (first 7 days) = Rate_Thompson + Rate_Rodriguez + Rate_Chen\nCombined rate (first 7 days) = (1/28) + (1/42) + (1/84) units of work per day.\nTo add these fractions, we find a common denominator. The least common multiple of 28, 42, and 84 is 84.\nCombined rate (first 7 days) = (3/84) + (2/84) + (1/84) = (3 + 2 + 1)/84 = 6/84 = 1/14 units of work per day.\n\nThe amount of work completed in the first 7 days is:\nWork done in first 7 days = Combined rate (first 7 days) * Time\nWork done in first 7 days = (1/14 units/day) * 7 days = 7/14 = 1/2 units of work.\n\nThe remaining work to be done is:\nRemaining work = Total work - Work done in first 7 days\nRemaining work = 1 - 1/2 = 1/2 units of work.\n\nAfter 7 days, Mr. Chen leaves the project. Mr. Thompson and Ms. Rodriguez continue working together. Their combined work rate for the remaining work is:\nCombined rate (after 7 days) = Rate_Thompson + Rate_Rodriguez\nCombined rate (after 7 days) = (1/28) + (1/42) units of work per day.\nUsing the common denominator 84:\nCombined rate (after 7 days) = (3/84) + (2/84) = 5/84 units of work per day.\n\nThe time taken to complete the remaining 1/2 unit of work by Mr. Thompson and Ms. Rodriguez is:\nTime for remaining work = Remaining work / Combined rate (after 7 days)\nTime for remaining work = (1/2) / (5/84) days\nTime for remaining work = (1/2) * (84/5) = 84/10 = 8.4 days.\n\nThe total time from the beginning of the project to completion is the sum of the time spent with all three artisans and the time spent with only two:\nTotal time = Time in first 7 days + Time for remaining work\nTotal time = 7 days + 8.4 days = 15.4 days.\n\nExpressing the answer as a decimal rounded to two decimal places, we get 15.40 days.",
